      "text": "cinematic photorealistic film still, present-day small Midwest town, 35mm film grain, a knees-up documentary photograph of two women deputies practicing an arrest on the blue foam mats of a small station gym, seen from the side at eye level. A woman with a dusty-pink bob in a plain gray T-shirt and tan uniform breeches handcuffs a blonde woman in a plain gray T-shirt and tan uniform breeches, standing close behind the blonde woman and holding the blonde woman's wrists together at the small of her back. One polished steel hinged handcuff is already locked on the blonde woman's right wrist, and the pink-haired deputy presses the second hinged cuff closed around the blonde woman's left wrist with her thumb. The pink-haired deputy, on the left of the frame, is a Korean woman of twenty-nine with a dusty-pink bob to the collar with dark roots, dark eyes and berry-pink lips; she looks down at the handcuffs on the blonde woman's wrists with calm, careful attention and a small, pleased smile. The blonde deputy, on the right of the frame, is a white woman of twenty-four with long platinum blonde hair with black streaks underneath, green eyes, smoky dark eye makeup and berry lipstick; she stands in profile facing right with her arms behind her back and looks back over her shoulder at the camera, rolling her eyes with a bored, bratty little smirk. Behind them, the low-ceilinged gym of a single-story annex: pale gray painted concrete block walls, a row of tall gray steel lockers with vented doors and a wooden bench in front of them, a black leather heavy bag hanging in the corner, white acoustic ceiling tiles with long fluorescent fixtures. Both women from the knees up, the handcuffs at the center of the frame and in sharp focus. Cool fluorescent light from above, warmed by a square of daylight from a small high window on the right, puts a bright glint on the polished steel handcuffs. Mat blue, concrete gray, locker gray, tan and dusty pink palette, natural skin texture, 35 mm lens.",
